"lines": [
{
"text": "Abram was ninety-nine years old",
"start": 12.561,
"end": 14.821
},
{
"text": "when the Lord appeared to him:",
"start": 16.121,
"end": 18.281
},
{
"text": "\u201cI am your God. Be well-pleasing before me,",
"start": 19.921,
"end": 23.001
},
{
"text": "and be blameless.\u201d",
"start": 23.101,
"end": 24.021
},
{
"text": "\u201cI will make my covenant between us,",
"start": 25.341,
"end": 27.522
},
{
"text": "and multiply you beyond measure.\u201d",
"start": 28.382,
"end": 30.722
},
{
"text": "Abram fell facedown,",
"start": 31.842,
"end": 33.422
},
{
"text": "and God spoke to him:",
"start": 34.242,
"end": 35.802
},
{
"text": "\u201cAs for me, this is my covenant with you:",
"start": 39.182,
"end": 42.222
},
{
"text": "you will father a multitude of nations.\u201d",
"start": 44.743,
"end": 48.383
},
{
"text": "\u201cYou will no longer be called Abram.",
"start": 50.563,
"end": 53.043
},
{
"text": "Your name will be Abraam,",
"start": 53.803,
"end": 55.963
},
{
"text": "for I have made you father of many nations.\u201d",
"start": 56.363,
"end": 60.523
},
{
"text": "\u201cI will make you exceedingly fruitful.",
"start": 62.424,
"end": 64.644
},
{
"text": "Nations and kings will come from you.\u201d",
"start": 65.264,
"end": 68.364
},
{
"text": "\u201cI will keep my covenant with you",
"start": 68.784,
"end": 71.244
},
{
"text": "and your descendants through every generation,",
"start": 72.344,
"end": 76.104
},
{
"text": "an everlasting covenant: I will be your God",
"start": 77.444,
"end": 81.045
},
{
"text": "and the God of your descendants.\u201d",
"start": 81.165,
"end": 83.265
},
{
"text": "\u201cI will give you and your descendants",
"start": 83.965,
"end": 86.425
},
{
"text": "all the land of Chanaan where you live as a stranger,",
"start": 86.825,
"end": 90.085
},
{
"text": "an everlasting possession; I will be their God.\u201d",
"start": 90.505,
"end": 98.886
},
{
"text": "God said to Abraam,",
"start": 99.006,
"end": 101.006
},
{
"text": "\u201cYou and your descendants through every generation",
"start": 102.206,
"end": 105.286
},
{
"text": "must fully keep my covenant.\u201d",
"start": 107.106,
"end": 109.506
},
{
"text": "\u201cThis is the covenant you must fully keep",
"start": 110.926,
"end": 113.306
},
{
"text": "between me and you,",
"start": 113.666,
"end": 114.887
},
{
"text": "and your descendants through their generations:",
"start": 115.187,
"end": 118.387
},
{
"text": "every male among you must be circumcised.\u201d",
"start": 118.967,
"end": 122.107
},
{
"text": "\u201cYou shall be circumcised in the flesh",
"start": 122.527,
"end": 125.307
},
{
"text": "of your foreskin. This will be the sign",
"start": 125.507,
"end": 127.607
},
{
"text": "of the covenant between us.\u201d",
"start": 127.687,
"end": 129.607
},
{
"text": "\u201cEvery boy, eight days old, must be circumcised",
"start": 132.728,
"end": 136.168
},
{
"text": "throughout your generations\u2014those born in your house,",
"start": 136.268,
"end": 139.828
},
{
"text": "and those bought with money from strangers,",
"start": 141.228,
"end": 144.728
},
{
"text": "who are not your descendants.\u201d",
"start": 144.788,
"end": 147.408
},
{
"text": "\u201cThose born in your house and those bought",
"start": 147.888,
"end": 150.289
},
{
"text": "with money must be circumcised.",
"start": 150.349,
"end": 152.749
},
{
"text": "My covenant will be marked on your flesh,",
"start": 153.509,
"end": 156.709
},
{
"text": "an everlasting covenant.\u201d",
"start": 156.849,
"end": 158.749
},
{
"text": "\u201cThe male not circumcised in the flesh",
"start": 159.289,
"end": 162.249
},
{
"text": "of his foreskin on the eighth day\u2014",
"start": 162.369,
"end": 164.429
},
{
"text": "that soul shall be utterly destroyed from its family,",
"start": 165.229,
"end": 170.71
},
{
"text": "for he has broken my covenant.\u201d",
"start": 172.57,
"end": 176.09
},
{
"text": "God said to Abraam,",
"start": 177.17,
"end": 179.27
},
{
"text": "\u201cYour wife Sara shall no longer be called Sara;",
"start": 179.55,
"end": 183.73
},
{
"text": "her name will be Sarrha.\u201d",
"start": 185.911,
"end": 187.971
},
{
"text": "\u201cI will bless her and give you a son by her.",
"start": 188.771,
"end": 192.231
},
{
"text": "I will bless him; he will become nations,",
"start": 193.111,
"end": 196.011
},
{
"text": "and kings of nations will come from him.\u201d",
"start": 196.131,
"end": 199.811
},
{
"text": "Abraam fell facedown and laughed,",
"start": 201.572,
"end": 203.792
},
{
"text": "saying in his heart, \u201cCan a child be born",
"start": 204.012,
"end": 206.532
},
{
"text": "to a man of a hundred? Can Sarrha,",
"start": 206.632,
"end": 209.672
},
{
"text": "at ninety years old, bear a child?\u201d",
"start": 210.532,
"end": 213.912
},
{
"text": "Abraam said to God,",
"start": 214.112,
"end": 215.932
},
{
"text": "\u201cMay Ismael live before you!\u201d",
"start": 216.712,
"end": 219.153
},
{
"text": "God said to Abraam, \u201cYes. Sarrha your wife",
"start": 224.633,
"end": 228.413
},
{
"text": "will bear you a son. You shall name him Isaac.",
"start": 228.473,
"end": 231.833
},
{
"text": "I will establish my covenant with him,",
"start": 232.873,
"end": 235.533
},
{
"text": "an everlasting covenant,",
"start": 235.793,
"end": 237.474
},
{
"text": "to be God to him and his seed after him.\u201d",
"start": 237.834,
"end": 241.874
},
{
"text": "\u201cAs for Ismael, I have heard you.",
"start": 244.374,
"end": 248.134
},
{
"text": "I have blessed him; I will make him fruitful",
"start": 248.994,
"end": 251.754
},
{
"text": "and multiply him greatly. He will father",
"start": 251.894,
"end": 255.035
},
{
"text": "twelve nations, and I will make him a great nation.\u201d",
"start": 256.195,
"end": 259.775
},
{
"text": "\u201cBut I will establish my covenant with Isaac,",
"start": 261.215,
"end": 264.175
},
{
"text": "whom Sarrha will bear to you at this season",
"start": 264.655,
"end": 268.175
},
{
"text": "next year.\u201d",
"start": 269.875,
"end": 270.515
},
{
"text": "When God had finished speaking with Abraam,",
"start": 272.316,
"end": 275.016
},
{
"text": "God went up from him.",
"start": 275.836,
"end": 277.316
},
{
"text": "Abraam took Ismael his son,",
"start": 278.736,
"end": 281.216
},
{
"text": "all born in his house and all bought with money,",
"start": 282.276,
"end": 285.736
},
{
"text": "every male in his household, and circumcised them",
"start": 286.456,
"end": 290.277
},
{
"text": "that very day, as God had told him.",
"start": 291.577,
"end": 294.797
},
{
"text": "Abraam was ninety-nine years old",
"start": 295.377,
"end": 298.977
},
{
"text": "when he was circumcised.",
"start": 300.757,
"end": 302.637
},
{
"text": "Ismael his son was thirteen years old",
"start": 304.497,
"end": 307.838
},
{
"text": "when he was circumcised.",
"start": 309.538,
"end": 311.838
},
{
"text": "That very day Abraam was circumcised,",
"start": 313.698,
"end": 319.798
},
{
"text": "and Ismael his son,",
"start": 319.898,
"end": 321.078
},
{
"text": "and every man in his household,",
"start": 323.018,
"end": 324.799
},
{
"text": "born in the house or bought with money",
"start": 326.359,
"end": 328.939
},
{
"text": "from foreigners.",
"start": 331.519,
"end": 332.639
},
{
"text": "from foreigners.",
"start": 347.96,
"end": 349.2
}
],
